From 427b248cfe21835816f2024b3a165280a5b44eba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:00:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add to_prev_step and to_prev_val iteration methods

Add default implementations of ZipperMoving::to_prev_step and
ZipperIteration::to_prev_val (plus their _observed forms), which visit
positions / values in the exact reverse of to_next_step / to_next_val.
Called at the root they move to the last position / value in the trie,
and they return false once they are back at the root.

The new methods are forwarded through the zipper lens macro and
PathTracker, covered by the shared zipper_moving_tests and
zipper_iteration_tests suites, documented in the book, and benchmarked
in the binary_keys, sparse_keys and superdense_keys benches.

Closes #120
